# Dynamic build (default): links against the distro CUPS/PAPPL shared libraries.
Package: br-thermal
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!static>
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 adduser,
 cups
Description: Brother thermal printer driver
 A CUPS/IPP printer driver for Brother thermal label printers.
 Implements the raster printing protocol via the PAPPL library.

# Static build (profile 'static'): CUPS and PAPPL are linked statically (built
# from source), so the package is self-contained and portable to older Debian
# releases (e.g. Bookworm) that lack a compatible libpappl/libcups. Only the
# base system libraries remain dynamic.
Package: br-thermal-static
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <static>
Provides: br-thermal (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: br-thermal
Replaces: br-thermal
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 adduser,
 cups
Description: Brother thermal printer driver (static build)
 A CUPS/IPP printer driver for Brother thermal label printers.
 Implements the raster printing protocol via the PAPPL library.
 .
 This build links CUPS and PAPPL statically, making it self-contained and
 installable on distributions whose system libpappl/libcups are missing or
 too old. It conflicts with and replaces the dynamically-linked br-thermal.